.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH KILL 1 "2026-09-01"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
kill \- Send signal to processes or list information about signals.
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBkill\fR [OPTIONS]... PID...
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Send signal to processes or list information about signals.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-l\fR, \fB\-\-list\fR
Lists signals
.TP
\fB\-t\fR, \fB\-\-table\fR
Lists table of signals
.TP
\fB\-s\fR, \fB\-\-signal\fR \fI<signal>\fR
Sends given signal instead of SIGTERM
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH "نسخه (VERSION)"
v(uutils coreutils) 0.11.0
